.TH QDCONTOUR2 1 "2026-05-02" "smartmet-qdcontour2" "SmartMet Tools"
.SH NAME
qdcontour2 \- render contour images and maps from querydata and shapefiles (v2)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qdcontour2
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ conffiles... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qdcontour2
is the successor of
.BR qdcontour (1)
with an updated rendering backend
.RB ( imagine2 ", " giza )
and improved color handling. It reads one or more control files
describing a rendering pipeline and produces raster images
.RB ( PNG ", " JPEG )
showing contours, isobands, weather symbols and shapefile-based map
backgrounds.
.PP
The control-file syntax is largely compatible with the original
qdcontour and is documented in the package's
.IR docs/qdcontour.txt .
For server-side rendering, the SmartMet WMS plugin is generally
preferred over qdcontour2.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h
Display the built-in help and exit.
.TP
.B \-v
Verbose mode.
.TP
.B \-f
Force overwriting of existing output images.
.TP
.BI \-q " querydata"
Use the given querydata file. Overrides any
.B querydata
directive in the control file.
.TP
.BI \-c " line"
Inject the given configuration line before processing the control
file. For example,
.B \-c
.I """format pdf"""
forces the PDF output backend.
.SH EXAMPLES
Render a single control file:
.PP
.RS 4
qdcontour2 map.cnf
.RE
.PP
Override input data and request PNG output:
.PP
.RS 4
qdcontour2 \-q forecast.sqd \-c "format png" map.cnf
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qdcontour (1),
.BR shape2ps (1),
.BR qdview (1),
.BR qdinfo (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Finnish Meteorological Institute
.PP
